WHY GPL?
--------
This subproject hard-depends on Etched (https://github.com/jacksonhardaway/etched)
which is GPL-3.0-only. The combined work — Etched plus the NeoBAE-Etched
bridge classes here — is therefore distributed under the GPL.

The underlying NeoBAE / miniBAE audio engine in the parent repository
remains under its original BSD-3-Clause license. Only the Minecraft
integration code under neobae/src/mc1.21.1/ is GPL-3.0.
